WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.522
Prepare before a fire.

00:00:01.522 --> 00:00:07.403
Put working smoke alarms on every level, inside bedrooms, and outside sleeping areas.

00:00:07.403 --> 00:00:10.170
Connect them so they all sound together.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:11.692
Test them every month.

00:00:11.692 --> 00:00:18.057
If you cannot hear a standard alarm, USFA lists vibrating pads, flashing lights, or strobes.

00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:19.257
Draw a map.

00:00:19.257 --> 00:00:21.470
Find two ways out of every room.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:22.992
Keep those ways clear.

00:00:22.992 --> 00:00:25.898
Pick a meeting place in front of the home.

00:00:25.898 --> 00:00:27.098
Practice.

00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:30.834
If someone may need extra help, arrange that help now.

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:33.000
This app cannot promise that help will arrive.
